 }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n            .brand_grid {\r\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n                row-gap: 4.1667vw;\r\n                text-align: center;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .brand_grid .logo_img {\r\n                margin-top: 0 !important;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:560px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 10px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:480px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 9px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:400px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 8px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"product_detail_wrap\">\n<section class=\"product_keyimg ptr\">\n<div class=\"key_txtbox w80 tl\"><img class=\"gc_elixir_logo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/gcoop_the_elixir_logo.png\"/>\n<p class=\"ip3 font_NGl mt_70\">라이프 스타일에 따라 달라지는<br/>\r\n나만의 묘약 레시피</p>\n<p class=\"ip5 lh_12 mt_30 wMax ptr\"><span class=\"font_NGl\">지쿱 디엘릭서</span><br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">화이트 글로우</span><img class=\"white_glow\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white.png\"/></p>\n<p class=\"ip4 lh_12\">속부터 채워지는<br/>\r\n피부 자신감!</p>\n<p class=\"ip3 font_NGl lh_12 mt_04em\">“진정한 이너뷰티를 위한<br/>\r\n피부개선 프로젝트”</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_key_img.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"ptr\">\n<div class=\"white_glow_start w90\">\n<p class=\"ip4 lh_12\"><span class=\"font_NGl\">디엘릭서 화이트 글로우로</span><br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">환하게 채워지는 하루</span></p>\n<p class=\"ip4 fw_600 mt_30\">“하루 한 포로 챙기는 피부 밸런스”</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 mt_50\">바쁜 일상 속 간편하고 맛있게<br/>\r\n아름다움을 위한 습관을 시작하세요.</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_01.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w90 mt_150\">\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600\">디엘릭서 <span class=\"color_purple\">화이트 글로우</span>의 특별함</p>\n<ul class=\"main_point tl mt_30\">\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_02_00.jpg\"/></li>\n<li>\n<ul class=\"flex_box\">\n<li>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_02_01.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\">주름+미백+보습 <span class=\"fw_600\">all-in-one 케어!</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_02_02.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"fw_600\">초저분자 &amp; 초고함량 콜라겐</span> 함유</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_02_03.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\">부원료 <span class=\"fw_600\">화이트토마토로 시너지</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_02_04.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\">부원료로 <span class=\"fw_600\">글루타치온, 엘라스틴, 비타민C, 비오틴</span> 함유</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_02_05.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"fw_600\">유기농 파이토 뉴트리언트</span> 함유</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"ptb_120 bg_gray mt_150\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 01</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_30\">주름+미백+보습 all-in-one 케어!</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">다양한 피부 고민에 맞는 솔루션을 제공 함으로서 <span class=\"fw_600 color_purple\">토탈 이너뷰티 케어</span></p>\n<div class=\"w75 grid_3step mt_70\">\n<div class=\"care_round_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_03_01.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"pd_2em\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">콜라겐</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_03em\">주름 ∙ 탄력</p>\n<p class=\"font_ICj p1 color_purple mt_30\"># 피부의 기둥 역할</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"care_round_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_03_02.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"pd_2em\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">화이트토마토</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_03em\">미백개선</p>\n<p class=\"font_ICj p1 color_purple mt_30\"># 먹는 자외선차단제</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"care_round_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_03_03.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"pd_2em\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">히알루론산</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_03em\">보습개선</p>\n<p class=\"font_ICj p1 color_purple mt_30\"># 피부 속 수분 잠금</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p0 mt_50 font_NGl color_gray\">* 원료적 설명에 한함</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 02</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_30\">초저분자, 초고함량 콜라겐 함유</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">300달톤의 저분자 콜라겐이 <span class=\"fw_600 color_purple\">한 포에 4,000 mg!</span></p>\n<div class=\"collagen_grid_2step mt_70\">\n<div class=\"flex_c bg_dark bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p2 flex_c_auto color_white pd_1em\">일반 콜라겐 (동물성)</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_04_01.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"flex_c bg_purple bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p2 flex_c_auto color_white pd_1em\">저분자 콜라겐 (어린)</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_04_02.jpg\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"collagen_grid_3step mt_30\">\n<div class=\"color_gray\">\n<p class=\"p1\">300,000 달톤</p>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">흡수율 2%</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p4\">&lt;</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p1\">300 달톤</p>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">흡수율 84%</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w75 pd_3em bg_gray mt_70 bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p1\">동물성 콜라겐에 비해 어린 콜라겐은 흡수율이 약 42배 정도 우수합니다.<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n어린 콜라겐은 분자가 작기 때문에 체내 흡수율이 높다는 장점이 있습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p0 mt_30 font_NGl color_gray\">* 원료적 설명에 한함</p>\n<div class=\"w75 ptb_120 bg_gray mt_100 bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p4\">미세한 300 달톤<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">초분자 어린콜라겐</span></p>\n<div class=\"ptr fish_scales\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_04_03.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"fish_scales_text tl\">\n<p class=\"ip3 fw_600\"><span class=\"color_purple\">어린 콜라겐</span>만 사용</p>\n<p class=\"ip0 color_gray\">※어린 : 魚鱗(물고기 비늘)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w80 pd_3_2em bg_white mt_100 bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p1\">디엘릭서 화이트 글로우 어린 콜라겐은 생선비늘에서 추출한<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n콜라겐 원료를 사용하여 300 달톤 이라는 미세한 분자량을 갖습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_120\">콜라겐 함량과 흡수율의 관계분석</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">콜라겐은 고함량일수록 우리 몸에 더 잘 흡수됩니다!</p>\n<div class=\"w80 bg_white plrb_2_3em mt_50 bdr_10\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_04_04.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1\">콜라겐의 흡수율은 섭취량에 비례하게 증가하여 고함량 콜라겐 섭취 시,<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n피부와 신체 곳곳에 필요한 양을 충분히 흡수시켜 줍니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w80 ptb_60 bg_white mt_30 bdr_10\">\n<div class=\"collagen_absorption ptr\">\n<p class=\"txt_01 ip0\">Free Hyp (mmol/mL)</p>\n<p class=\"txt_02 ip0 lh_10\">Time (h)</p>\n<div class=\"tl absorption_box lh_10\">\n<p class=\"colorball bg_purple\"> </p>\n<p class=\"ip0 color_purple\">30.8mg/kg</p>\n<p class=\"colorball bg_dark\"> </p>\n<p class=\"ip0\">153.8mg/kg</p>\n<p class=\"colorball bg_darkgray\"> </p>\n<p class=\"ip0\">384.6mg/kg</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"txt_03 wMax color_white bg_purple\">\n<p>1500mg 콜라겐 섭취결과 흡수량 적음<br/>\r\n(30.8mg/kg : 50kg 기준)</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_04_05.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_70\">실제로 함량과 흡수율을 분석한 논문에 따르면,<br/>\r\n하루 1500mg의 적은 함량을 섭취한 후 관찰 결과,<br/>\r\n혈중 농도에 유의미한 변화가 나타나지 않았습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"w80 p0 mt_50 font_NGl color_gray\">출처 : Dose-dependent changes in the levels of free and peptide forms of hydroxyproline in human plasma after collagen hydrolysate ingestion, Food Chemistry, 159:328-332(2014)</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 03</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_30\">부원료 화이트토마토 추출물로 시너지</p>\n<img class=\"mt_50\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_05.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt-05em\">화이트 토마토란?</p>\n<div class=\"grid_txtList wMax mg_auto mt_30\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/common_img/checkbox_style_01.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p1\">일반적인 토마토와 달리 흰색은 띠고 있는 토마토</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/common_img/checkbox_style_01.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p1\">무색 카로티노이드 피토엔&amp;피토플루엔* 풍부</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/common_img/checkbox_style_01.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p1\">기미와 주근깨의 멜라닌을 감소시킴</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/common_img/checkbox_style_01.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p1\">해외가 주목하고 있는 이너뷰티 신소재</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_120\">피토엔&amp;피토플루엔 이란?</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_04em\">화이트 토마토에 풍부하다고 알려진 무색 카로티노이드</p>\n<div class=\"phytoene_phytofluene mt_50\">\n<div class=\"bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 color_white bg_purple pd_1em\">피토엔</p>\n<p class=\"p1 bg_lightgray pd_2em\">자외선B 차단</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bdr_10\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 color_white bg_purple pd_1em\">피토플루엔</p>\n<p class=\"p1 bg_lightgray pd_2em\">자외선A 차단</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p0 mt_30 font_NGl color_gray\">*제품이 아닌 원물에 대한 설명입니다.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_120 bg_gray ptb_100\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 04</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_30\">부원료로 글루타치온, 엘라스틴,<br/>\r\n비타민C, 비오틴 함유</p>\n<div class=\"sr_materials ptr mt_50\">\n<p class=\"ip2 flex_c_auto color_vpurple fw_600\">글루타치온</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 flex_c_auto color_vpurple fw_600\">엘라스틴</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 flex_c_auto color_vpurple fw_600\">비타민C</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 flex_c_auto color_vpurple fw_600\">비오틴</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_06.jpg\"/></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 05</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_30\">유기농 파이토 뉴트리언트 함유</p>\n<div class=\"phytonutrient w75 mt_50 ptr\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">Phyto</p>\n<p class=\"p0\">식물</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600\">Phytonutrient</p>\n<p class=\"p0\">파이토 뉴트리언트</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">Nutrient</p>\n<p class=\"p0\">영양소</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_white/the_elixir_white_img_07_01.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"w75 mt_70 tl\">\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600\">파이토 뉴트리언트?</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_04em\">Phyto(Plant:식물)와 Nutrient(영양소)의 합성어 입니다. 즉 식물만이 가지고 있는 고유한 영양소를 의미합니다.<br/>\r\n파이토 뉴트리언트는 자외선과 같은 외부공격, 물리적인 스트레스, 산화 등으로부터 식물 자신을 보호 하기 위해서 만들어내는 생리활성물질 입니다.</p>\n<p class=\"mt_100\"><span class=\"p4 fw_600\">유기농 파이토 뉴트리언트</span> <span class=\"p3 font_NGl\">(오가닉 비건믹스)</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_04em\">피부에 이로운 역할을 하는 파이토 케미컬을 엄선하여 안전하고 건강하게 담았습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ptr\">\n<div class=\"Phytochemical w75\">\n<ul class=\"Phytochemical_grid\">\n<li class=\"p0 fw_600\">유기농 감귤</li>\n<li class=\"p0 fw_600\">유기